VPS Avenger preset database (com.platform.vps-avenger-presets)

The files under data/ are the catalog of VPS Avenger's expansions — the commercial expansions, as
the catalog lists them: their categories, preset names, oscillator tab names and macro names —
taken from the preset database of the avenger_control project. Its developer gave the database to
this project without restriction, to be part of it (2026-10-02). The avenger_control tool has
not been published and has no licence of its own.

LICENCE: these files are licensed as the rest of this repository, GPL-3.0-or-later (module.toml's
`license`).

What is not here: nothing about who owns which expansion, and no expansion the catalog does not
list. tools/avenger-presets/convert.py keeps only the catalog's two rosters, "Complete" and
"Factory Standard", and drops everything else in the exports unread.

VPS Avenger, its expansions and their names belong to their makers. They are named here to say
what this data describes; this project is not affiliated with them.

The reader, src/main.luau, is part of this repository's code and is licensed the same way.
